    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to analyze a planning document regarding a shift from AI-driven traffic routing to fixed-timer smart lights in Santiago. The assistant argues against the change, noting the loss of efficiency, and eventually proposes a hybrid solution to mitigate the committee's concerns about predictability.",
